#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""claimclicks_orchestrator.py v1 — Full ClaimClicks claim flow.

Runs on the REMOTE server. Uses claimclicks_daemon.py as a subprocess.

Flow:
  1. Launch daemon (persistent browser)
  2. Navigate to faucet URL
  3. Click "Claim Free BTC" to open modal
  4. Fill FaucetPay username
  5. Extract anti-bot link images + order image
  6. Read numbers via 2Captcha image-to-text API
  7. Click anti-bot links in correct order
  8. Solve IconCaptcha (pixel-based unique icon finder)
  9. Click Claim button
  10. Parse result, log to ledger

Cost: ~$0.001-0.003 per image read (2Captcha), IconCaptcha is free (pixel-based).
Vector: САМООБЕСПЕЧЕНИЕ (L0).

Usage:
  python3 claimclicks_orchestrator.py btc
  python3 claimclicks_orchestrator.py btc doge ltc
  python3 claimclicks_orchestrator.py --all
  python3 claimclicks_orchestrator.py --loop --interval 180 btc
"""

